#: includes/contactform7/class-formprocessor.php:117
msgid "Newsman: CF7 email field is empty."
msgstr "Newsman: het e-mailveld van het CF7-formulier is leeg."

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:247
msgid ""
"When on, the form uses the list and segment configured in Newsman - Sync; "
"the per-form Newsman List and Newsman Segment values below are stored but "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Indien aan, gebruikt het formulier de lijst en het segment dat is "
"geconfigureerd in Newsman - Sync; de per-formulier Newsman-lijst en Newsman-"
"segment-waarden hieronder worden opgeslagen maar genegeerd."

#: includes/elementor/class-atomicformcontrols.php:258
#: includes/elementor/class-formcontrols.php:127
msgid "Newsman List"
